# "Porsche 992 GT3 RS" by VTX (VTX_car) on Sketchfab (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: credit
# the author, non-commercial use only, share derived models under the same
# license). tools/fetch_models.sh downloads it with a Sketchfab API token.
# The quarry HDRI's low sun lights the front three-quarter view and throws a
# long shadow to the right.
#
# Unlike the Carrera 4S it has a cockpit. Its windows are dark glossy shells
# with 40% alpha (alphaMode BLEND): 40% of the rays stop on them and the rest
# see the seats and the roll cage. The file faces -z: turned to face the camera.

image_width  960
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 256
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 5.0 1.3 5.5  lookat 0 0.55 0  vfov 32

environment ../textures/quarry_01_1k.hdr  rotate 130
exposure    -0.5
tonemap     aces

material asphalt principled color 0.35 0.35 0.35 roughness 0.5
ground asphalt

mesh ../models/external/porsche_992_gt3_rs.glb  rotate_y 180
